@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
title UC10 - select and import materials
|Teacher|
start
:Open native Folder content or Folder/File Settings;
:Press Import materials;
|Moodle / CourseBridge|
:Open scoped browser inside native picker;
|Teacher|
:Choose profile and optional compact filters;
:Browse folders and tick files/folders;
:Choose destination and folder structure;
:Review selection;
|CourseBridge|
:Expand authorized descendants once;
:Check policies, current draft and native limits;
if (Review allowed?) then (yes)
 :Show paths, original declarations and copy/skip decisions;
 |Teacher|
 :Press Import reviewed materials;
 |CourseBridge|
 :Recheck approval and copy transactionally to native draft;
 :Refresh the original filemanager;
 |Teacher|
 if (Save?) then (yes)
  |Moodle|
  :Save native activity content;
 else (cancel)
  |Moodle|
  :Keep saved activity unchanged;
 endif
else (no)
 :Explain conflicts or policy/permission/limit failure;
 :Retain choices for correction and another review;
endif
stop
@enduml
